{"seq":1,"slug":"expect-actual-mechanism","title":"expect/actual 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/expect-actual-mechanism","wordCount":744,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"expect-actual-机制\">expect/actual 机制</h1><p>expect/actual 是 KMP 的编译时契约系统——在 <code>commonMain</code> 中用 <code>expect</code> 声明一个函数、类或属性的签名（不含实现），然后在每个平台源集中用 <code>actual</code> 提供对应的原生实现。编译器在构建时严格匹配两端的签名，确保类型安全。这是 KMP 区别于运行时多态（接口 + DI）的独特机制，适合低级别、性能敏感或需要直接访问平台 API 的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>expect/actual 的工作流程可以概括为：声明契约 → 提供实现 → 编译期合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph commonMain&#10;        A[expect fun getPlatform String]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph androidMain&#10;        B[actual fun getPlatform = Android SDK_INT]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph iosMain&#10;        C[actual fun getPlatform = UIDevice.systemName]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B&#10;    A --&gt; C&#10;    D[编译器验证] --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph commonMain\n        A[expect fun getPlatform String]\n    end\n    subgraph androidMain\n        B[actual fun getPlatform = Android SDK_INT]\n    end\n    subgraph iosMain\n        C[actual fun getPlatform = UIDevice.systemName]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B\n    A --&gt; C\n    D[编译器验证] --&gt; A\n    D --&gt; B\n    D --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>expect/actual</th>\n<th>接口 + DI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解析时机</td>\n<td>编译时</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能开销</td>\n<td>零（编译期消除）</td>\n<td>虚分派开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>平台 API 桥接、底层原语</td>\n<td>业务逻辑抽象、可测试性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>每个平台必须提供 actual</td>\n<td>可有多个实现、可 mock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测试性</td>\n<td>不易 mock</td>\n<td>天然支持 fake/mock</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"函数级-expect-actual\">函数级 expect/actual</h2><p>最基本的用法是声明一个期望函数并在各平台实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect fun currentTimeMillis(): Long&#10;&#10;// androidMain (JVM)&#10;actual fun currentTimeMillis(): Long = System.currentTimeMillis()&#10;&#10;// iosMain (Native)&#10;import platform.Foundation.NSDate&#10;import platform.Foundation.timeIntervalSince1970&#10;&#10;actual fun currentTimeMillis(): Long =&#10;    (NSDate().timeIntervalSince1970 * 1000).toLong()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun currentTimeMillis(): Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain (JVM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun currentTimeMillis(): Long = System.currentTimeMillis()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain (Native)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.Foundation.NSDate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.Foundation.timeIntervalSince1970</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun currentTimeMillis(): Long =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (NSDate().timeIntervalSince1970 * 1000).toLong()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器确保：签名完全匹配（参数类型、返回类型、可见性）、每个目标平台都有且仅有一个 actual、expect 声明不含函数体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类级-expect-actual\">类级 expect/actual</h2><p>当需要封装一组相关的平台行为时，可以使用 expect class：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect class PlatformFile(path: String) {&#10;    fun readText(): String&#10;    fun writeText(content: String)&#10;    fun exists(): Boolean&#10;}&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;import java.io.File&#10;&#10;actual class PlatformFile actual constructor(private val path: String) {&#10;    private val file = File(path)&#10;    actual fun readText(): String = file.readText()&#10;    actual fun writeText(content: String) { file.writeText(content) }&#10;    actual fun exists(): Boolean = file.exists()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;import platform.Foundation.*&#10;&#10;actual class PlatformFile actual constructor(private val path: String) {&#10;    private val manager = NSFileManager.defaultManager&#10;    actual fun readText(): String =&#10;        NSString.stringWithContentsOfFile(path, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null) ?: &quot;&quot;&#10;    actual fun writeText(content: String) {&#10;        (content as NSString).writeToFile(path, true, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null)&#10;    }&#10;    actual fun exists(): Boolean = manager.fileExistsAtPath(path)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class PlatformFile(path: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun readText(): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun writeText(content: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun exists(): Boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import java.io.File</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class PlatformFile actual constructor(private val path: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val file = File(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun readText(): String = file.readText()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun writeText(content: String) { file.writeText(content) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun exists(): Boolean = file.exists()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.Foundation.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class PlatformFile actual constructor(private val path: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val manager = NSFileManager.defaultManager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun readText(): String =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        NSString.stringWithContentsOfFile(path, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null) ?: \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun writeText(content: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (content as NSString).writeToFile(path, true, NSUTF8StringEncoding, null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun exists(): Boolean = manager.fileExistsAtPath(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"expect-actual-与中间源集\">expect/actual 与中间源集</h2><p>expect/actual 可以在中间源集中提供 actual 实现，为更具体的平台源集共享代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect fun getDeviceType(): String&#10;&#10;// nativeMain（覆盖所有 native 目标）&#10;// 不能在这里 actual——因为 iOS 和 Linux 的实现不同&#10;&#10;// iosMain（覆盖 iosArm64 和 iosSimulatorArm64）&#10;import platform.UIKit.UIDevice&#10;&#10;actual fun getDeviceType(): String =&#10;    UIDevice.currentDevice.model  // 一次 actual 覆盖两个 iOS 目标&#10;&#10;// linuxMain&#10;actual fun getDeviceType(): String = &quot;Linux Server&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun getDeviceType(): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// nativeMain（覆盖所有 native 目标）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不能在这里 actual——因为 iOS 和 Linux 的实现不同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain（覆盖 iosArm64 和 iosSimulatorArm64）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import platform.UIKit.UIDevice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun getDeviceType(): String =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UIDevice.currentDevice.model  // 一次 actual 覆盖两个 iOS 目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// linuxMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun getDeviceType(): String = \"Linux Server\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    E[expect in commonMain] --&gt; A1[actual in iosMain]&#10;    E --&gt; A2[actual in androidMain]&#10;    E --&gt; A3[actual in linuxMain]&#10;    A1 --&gt; T1[iosArm64]&#10;    A1 --&gt; T2[iosSimulatorArm64]\">flowchart TD\n    E[expect in commonMain] --&gt; A1[actual in iosMain]\n    E --&gt; A2[actual in androidMain]\n    E --&gt; A3[actual in linuxMain]\n    A1 --&gt; T1[iosArm64]\n    A1 --&gt; T2[iosSimulatorArm64]</pre><p>关键规则：actual 声明应放在能覆盖最多同类目标的最高中间源集中，避免在每个叶子目标重复实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"expect-actual-的高级用法\">expect/actual 的高级用法</h2><h3 id=\"类型别名-typealias\">类型别名（typealias）</h3><p>当平台已有完全匹配的类型时，可以用 <code>actual typealias</code> 直接映射：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect class AtomicInt(value: Int) {&#10;    fun get(): Int&#10;    fun set(newValue: Int)&#10;    fun incrementAndGet(): Int&#10;}&#10;&#10;// jvmMain — 直接映射到 java.util.concurrent.atomic&#10;actual typealias AtomicInt = java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class AtomicInt(value: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun get(): Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun set(newValue: Int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun incrementAndGet(): Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// jvmMain — 直接映射到 java.util.concurrent.atomic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual typealias AtomicInt = java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"枚举类\">枚举类</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect enum class LogLevel {&#10;    DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR&#10;}&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual enum class LogLevel {&#10;    DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR&#10;    // 可以添加 Android 特有的方法&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect enum class LogLevel {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual enum class LogLevel {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 可以添加 Android 特有的方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"何时用-expect-actual-vs-接口抽象\">何时用 expect/actual vs 接口抽象</h2><p>实践中的决策准则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判断维度</th>\n<th>选 expect/actual</th>\n<th>选接口 + DI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能关键路径</td>\n<td>是（零开销）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要 mock 测试</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现可能变化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要多个实现</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接访问平台 API</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>间接的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模业务逻辑</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最佳实践是：用 expect/actual 做&quot;底层 shim&quot;（平台日志、时间戳、文件路径、UUID 生成），用接口抽象做业务层的可测试依赖注入。两者可以组合——expect/actual 提供平台原语，业务接口的默认实现内部调用这些原语。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>expect/actual 是编译时契约，零运行时开销，编译器严格校验签名匹配</li>\n<li>支持函数、类、属性、枚举的 expect/actual 声明</li>\n<li>actual 应放在最高可覆盖的中间源集中，减少重复实现</li>\n<li>typealias 可以零成本映射到已有平台类型</li>\n<li>对于业务逻辑，优先使用接口 + DI 以获得可测试性；expect/actual 保留给底层平台桥接</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"multiplatform-networking\">跨平台网络与序列化</a>——expect/actual 在 HTTP 引擎选择中的应用</li>\n<li><a href=\"multiplatform-persistence\">跨平台持久化</a>——数据库驱动的平台适配模式</li>\n<li><a href=\"../kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/expect-actual\">Kotlin 高级特性：expect/actual</a>——语言机制的完整规范</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"expect/actual 机制","id":"expect-actual-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"函数级 expect/actual","id":"函数级-expect-actual"},{"level":2,"text":"类级 expect/actual","id":"类级-expect-actual"},{"level":2,"text":"expect/actual 与中间源集","id":"expect-actual-与中间源集"},{"level":2,"text":"expect/actual 的高级用法","id":"expect-actual-的高级用法"},{"level":3,"text":"类型别名（typealias）","id":"类型别名-typealias"},{"level":3,"text":"枚举类","id":"枚举类"},{"level":2,"text":"何时用 expect/actual vs 接口抽象","id":"何时用-expect-actual-vs-接口抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Kotlin/Native 内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/foundations/kotlin-native-memory-model"},"next":{"title":"跨平台网络与序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-networking"}}